SUMMARY:State TAT return due for July to September 2026 (TA-1)
DESCRIPTION:File Form TA-1 and pay the state TAT for July to September 2026
  on Hawaii Tax Online. It counts as filed with the City and County of Hono
 lulu too.\nhttps://hitax.hawaii.gov/\n\nFrom hawaiirentaltax.com. Rules ch
 ecked October 1\, 2026. This is general information\, not tax advice.
