SUMMARY:County TAT payment due for July to September 2026 (OTAT)
DESCRIPTION:Pay the City and County of Honolulu its 3% TAT for July to Sept
 ember 2026. There's no county return\, just the payment.\nhttps://otatpay.
 honolulu.gov/\nPaying from a bank account is free. Cards cost 3%.\n\nFrom 
 hawaiirentaltax.com. Rules checked October 1\, 2026. This is general infor
 mation\, not tax advice.
